VALUES ('996e99e3-8d5d-595f-a6a3-52e29d736e39', 'Organization Status', 'Maintain Organization Status records', 'Create, find and maintain Organization Status records. The list shows every Organization Status you have access to — select a row to open it, or use New to add one. Each row is a single Organization Status, described by 6 fields.

Id and Code are unique: no two Organization Status records may share the same value, and a save that would duplicate one is rejected. Code, Name, Sequence and Is Active must be filled in before the record can be saved.

